{"id": "P1", "source_run": "sim-r1", "at": "2026-11-17T20:58:38+0800", "situation": "競品首頁選單有指定關鍵字的錨文字，但 robots 列出的 sitemap 索引裡找不到對應的大量頁面；資料卡分區顯示某個資料夾的網址數量異常多，而且是靠資料夾探測才找到它的獨立 sitemap。這時要確認這個資料夾是不是關鍵字量產頁群，以及指定關鍵字有哪些變體頁。", "route": "1. sitemap_tree：先 build，再對大分區做 sample 和 search 指定關鍵字，因為要知道量產頁群的網址樣式、變體頁數量，以及這些頁在哪個 sitemap 檔\n2. inspect_page：看選單錨文字連到的入口頁和 2 到 3 個關鍵字變體頁的 summary，因為要比對模板結構、canonical 和 JSON-LD\n3. inspect_page：用 link_filter 篩外連品牌和同資料夾的連結，因為要確認 CTA 的 rel、推廣參數和站內互連數\n4. polite_fetch：讀 robots.txt，核對這個 sitemap 有沒有列在 robots，因為要確認是否只有探測才找得到", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0103", "E-0104", "E-0107", "E-0154", "E-0108", "E-0110", "E-0114", "E-0150", "E-0151", "E-0135"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0103"], "call_n": 6}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0104"], "call_n": 7}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0107"], "call_n": 10}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0108"], "call_n": 11}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0110"], "call_n": 12}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a 娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0114"], "call_n": 14}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/robots.txt", "evidence_ids": ["E-0135"], "call_n": 23}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0150"], "call_n": 29}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/wordcup/3a娛樂城", "evidence_ids": ["E-0151"], "call_n": 30}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0154"], "call_n": 34}]}
{"id": "P2", "source_run": "sim-r1", "at": "2026-11-17T20:58:47+0800", "situation": "RDAP 的註冊日期很新，但 Wayback 存檔早好幾年；sitemap 裡還有看起來像舊站短網址代碼或舊分類名的分區。這時懷疑是過期網域再利用，要確認舊站主題，以及新站有沒有沿用舊網址。", "route": "1. wayback：用 old_urls 列舊網址，再用 snapshot 讀一個舊首頁，因為要知道舊站主題和當年用過的網址樣式\n2. wayback：用 check_current 看舊網址現在回什麼狀態碼，因為要分出哪些舊網址被接住、哪些已失效\n3. polite_fetch：跟著轉址抓被接住的舊網址最終頁，再用 inspect_page 看內容，因為只看轉址可能只是補斜線\n4. sitemap_tree：search 舊代碼字首，核對 sitemap 裡有幾個同名頁，因為只驗一頁不能推成策略", "result": "照走", "avoid_reason": "", "paired_id": "", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119", "E-0145", "E-0147", "E-0128", "E-0130", "E-0134", "E-0157", "E-0162", "E-0156", "E-0155"], "route_tools": [{"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0119"], "call_n": 16}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kAPB2a", "evidence_ids": ["E-0128"], "call_n": 17}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kAPB2a/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0130"], "call_n": 19}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/2kAPB2a/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0130", "E-0134"], "call_n": 22}, {"tool": "wayback", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0145"], "call_n": 25}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "web.archive.org", "path": "/web/20240525015210id_/https://2030.tw/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0145", "E-0147"], "call_n": 26}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0155"], "call_n": 35}, {"tool": "sitemap_tree", "domain": null, "path": null, "evidence_ids": ["E-0156"], "call_n": 36}, {"tool": "polite_fetch", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5G_Taiwan/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0157"], "call_n": 37}, {"tool": "inspect_page", "domain": "2030.tw", "path": "/5G_Taiwan/", "evidence_ids": ["E-0157", "E-0162"], "call_n": 41}]}
